cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the version-specific DOI for the snapshot you used and the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "MultiOmics_Alterations_HUUC: multi-omics analysis pipeline for HIV-exposed mother-newborn cohorts"
abstract: >-
  Statistical-analysis and figure-generation pipeline for the multi-omics
  study of HIV-exposed (HEU) versus HIV-unexposed (HUU) mothers and their
  newborns from the Kenya and Zambia cohorts. Includes maternal univariate
  effect-size estimation, lasso stability paths, sPLS-DA / PLSR, and
  neonatal stability-selection biomarker discovery with volcano and
  violin plots.
